Z||000000||gusto||12-27-2001||01:27 AM||||Ok heres the deal. My cousin has a friend with a supra. After watching "The Fast&The Furious" they are convinced the supra is the fastest car on the road. I haven't seen the movie yet, but they claim near the end a supra kills a ferrari. Now obviously those were not stock, but they keep saying his supra could atleast run with ANY stock vette, viper, mustang, or fiero. His supra is turbo charged w/twin cams. I got a 85SEV6. Does any know about the supra? Should I even bother racing him, once my car is running? I want to shut'em up. (This same cousin also beat me in a mini van) What I don't want is to look like an ass.               -Thanks<p>[This message has been edited by gusto (edited 12-28-2001).]||||reg||5
