Z||000002||Fiero*101||12-27-2001||01:57 AM||||Yeah no offence to you but thats like committing suicide(sp?)<BR>Did you just see what you typed Turbo charged with twin Cams<P>and Smoooth is right 700 Horses!<P>Unless you plan on seeing just tailights for a little bit i would just sit there  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>But it is a nice car and of course the supra in the F&F wasnt stock all the movie was,was about supercharging this and adding this. <BR>"whats the retail on one of those?" "More then you can afford pal" "FERRARI" "Dom says SMOKEM"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>sorry i was bored <P>------------------<BR>Fiero*101<BR>Gold 86 SE 2M6<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycar101.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Fiero*101||12-27-2001||02:10 AM||||Ok my last i was being a Jack a$$.<BR>Sorry. I just looked at the specs on the Supra at <A HREF="http://www.Supras.com" TARGET=_blank>www.Supras.com</A> <P>I guess it all depends on what you have in your car. and what he has in his <P>Bone stock the Supra Mk4 makes 225 horse power<BR>the Twin Turbo makes 320<BR>So what kind of Supra is it? <P>Sorry about not getting the facts for you and basing it on the movie  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>But if you want to check it out just look it up.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Fiero*101<BR>Gold 86 SE 2M6<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycar101.jpg"> ||||reg||1
