Z||000019||FieroKyle||12-28-2001||08:28 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GTFiero1:<BR><B>wow, blackstang is right<P>[This message has been edited by GTFiero1 (edited 12-28-2001).]</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>shocking, isn't it <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000020||NOCONES||12-28-2001||08:36 PM||||oh yeah.. i fogot blackstang is right..<P>turbo cars are real expensive to mod..<BR>i'm sure the guy with the 12 second minivan has at least 300-1k into his van.. that's insane amounts of money<p>[This message has been edited by NOCONES (edited 12-28-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000021||artherd||12-29-2001||01:52 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BlackStang95:<BR><B>Turbo Supras are nice cars, but stock they are not the gods the riceboys think they are.<BR>The fastest year was the 93 and it got<BR>1993   Toyota Supra Turbo                     4.9            13.4<P>Not bad at all, I guess it depends on what you consider "run with".  But it's certainly not enough to beat any stock stang, <BR>...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>... Except yours  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Sorry, I couldn't resist.<P>Toss a Corbra 4.6 DOHC in there, come 'on, do it!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>PS: In all seriousness, you're dead on.  The Supras aren't all that exciting stock.  It's the moddable potential in the MK4s that scare me.  I personally know a gent who dyno-ed his at a peak of 761 HP at the *wheels*. &lt;wets pants&gt;  I won't be drag racing him anytime soon...  He's outrun crotch-rocket superbikes on the freeway, says other cars are mostly a waste of time  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">      <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red.                     "Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver, In-Progreess.                                        -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
